# The server image is built from the repository root
# (docker build -f flutter_full_stack_server/Dockerfile .), so without this the
# whole repository goes to the Docker daemon as build context - the scorer's
# exports alone are gigabytes. Only what the Dockerfile copies goes in.
*
!pubspec.lock
!flutter_full_stack_server/
flutter_full_stack_server/.dart_tool/
flutter_full_stack_server/build/
# Language packs are mounted at run time, never baked into the image.
flutter_full_stack_server/models/
